      "Before the District Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission if the consideration paid does not exceed Rs 50 lakh, the State Commission above that up to Rs 2 crore, and the National Commission above Rs 2 crore. Section 34(2)(d) of the Consumer Protection Act 2019 lets you file where you reside or personally work for gain, so an online buyer can file at home rather than at the seller's city."
